            {
              "content": "=You are an expert social media copywriter.\nWrite a high-performing caption for the topic: “{{ $json.Topic }}”.\nThe video features ultra-realistic, AI-generated ASMR content where glass objects are being sliced with a knife.\nMake it scroll-stopping, short, and engaging.\n\nGenerate a short, non-generic caption for each platform. Captions must follow exact max-lengths and these best practices:\n\n\n• TikTok (max 4000 chars)\n– Lead with CTA or question\n– 3–5 trending hashtags\n– Sprinkle emojis for tone\n\n• LinkedIn (max 3000 chars)\n– Lead with a strong professional hook\n– Keep a professional, insightful tone\n– 3–5 relevant hashtags\n– Minimal, tasteful emojis\n\n• Facebook post (max 3000 chars)\n–\tFirst 125 chars must punch\n–\tUse line breaks or emojis\n–\tInclude CTA within first 125\n–\t2–3 relevant hashtags\n\nOutput only valid JSON.\nExample output:\n\n{\n\"TikTok\":\"…\",\n\"LinkedIn\":\"…\",\n\"Facebook\":\"…\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
